  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "アローラの　まもりがみと　される\nポケモンから　もらった　いし。\nかがやきに　ひみつが　あるという。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "알로라의 수호신으로 여겨지는\n포켓몬으로부터 받은 돌.\n빛에 비밀이 있다고 한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從被認為是阿羅拉守護神的\n寶可夢處得到的石頭。\n據說其光輝包含著某種秘密。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pierre donnée par un Pokémon gardien d’Alola.\nSon éclat cache un secret.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Stein, den du von einem der Schutzpatrone\nAlolas erhalten hast. Es heißt, dass sich hinter\ndem Glitzern ein Geheimnis verberge.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Piedra con un misterioso brillo entregada por un\nPokémon considerado como uno de los espíritus\nguardianes de Alola.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pietra ricevuta dal Pokémon protettore di Alola.\nDietro la sua lucentezza si nasconde un segreto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A stone entrusted by a Pokémon that has been\nvenerated as a guardian deity in the Alola region.\nThere is said to be some secret in how it sparkles.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "アローラの　守り神と　される\nポケモンから　もらった　石。\nかがやきに　秘密が　あるという。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "从被认为是阿罗拉守护神的\n宝可梦那里得到的石头。\n据说其光辉下有着某种秘密。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
